NAME: Cameras

DESCRIPTION:

To take a photo tap the white circle.
This will bring up the Android Camera,
finish taking the photo using Android
Camera.

Switch between Gallery and Location
views by tapping View. When in Location
view, the photos are orgznized by the
location at which they were taken.

Tap a photo and drag or pinch to pan
and zoom.

Tap Del to enable deletion of photos.
Then, to actually delete a photo, tap
the red X at the upper right of the
photo.

